🔹 Kya banega?

User password type karega aur tum show karoge:

Weak ❌
Medium ⚠️
Strong ✅
🧠 Isme kya logic lagega?

Tum check kar sakte ho:

Length (>= 8)
Uppercase letter (A-Z)
Lowercase letter (a-z)
Number (0-9)
Special character (!@#$)

🎨 UI Idea:
Input box
Niche text: “Password Strength: Weak/Medium/Strong”
Color change:
Red → Weak
Yellow → Medium
Green → Strong